OL,3,AMicrosoft scrambles to solve global
OL,4,Aoutage affecting tens of thousands but
OL,5,Asays fixes not going 'as expected'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA global Microsoft outage is continuing
OL,8,Fto affect tens of thousands of users -
OL,9,Fhere's what we know
OL,11,FServices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,12,FAI software Copilot have been hit with
OL,13,Fconnectivity problems for more than 10
OL,14,Fhours
OL,16,FReports of issues with Outlook alone
OL,17,Fpeaked globally at about 140,000 on
OL,18,FThursday, according to monitoring
OL,19,Fwebsite Downdetector - this went down
OL,20,Fto 28,000 overnight
