OL,5,Asays fixes not going 'as expected'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMicrosoft says its attempts to fix the
OL,8,Fissue are not "taking as expected" - it
OL,9,Fadds that the issue hasn't been caused
OL,10,Fby a cyber-security incident
OL,12,FMore than 430 million people use
OL,13,FMicrosoft 365 apps, and tech giants
OL,14,FOpenAI and Anthropic have reported
OL,15,Fproblems as a result of the outage
